              "value": "| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |",
